Gate supply passive charge-delivery envelope (not TPS61023 control model)
Vsource src 0 4.903554936103582
Vcut ctl 0 PWL(0 1 15u 1 15.001u 0)
Ssrc src bulk ctl 0 CUT
.model CUT SW(Ron=.001 Roff=1e12 Vt=.5 Vh=.05)
Rbulk bulk cb .01
Cbulk cb 0 4e-06
Rtrace bulk li 0.05
Ltrace li pin 1e-07
Rlocal pin cl .02
Llocal cl cc 1n
Clocal cc 0 5e-07
Rfast pin cf .02
Lfast cf cff 1n
Cfast cff 0 60n
Iload pin 0 PWL(0 0 20u 0 2.01e-05 0.8 2.0200000000000003e-05 0 29.314u 0 2.9814e-05 0.2 3.0314e-05 0)
Rdc pin 0 1G
.options method=gear reltol=.0005
.tran 1n 40u
.meas tran vmin MIN v(pin) FROM=19u TO=40u
.meas tran vmax MAX v(pin) FROM=19u TO=40u
.end
